---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Jian Liu | Interdisciplinary Researcher"
  description="Jian Liu is an interdisciplinary researcher working across bioinformatics, artificial intelligence, and scientific software, with interests in AI for Science, scientific agents, and computational biology."
  activePath="/"
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-profile">
        <div class="hero-photo-frame">
          <img src="/jian-liu-profile.svg?v=4" alt="Portrait of Jian Liu outdoors" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span><span data-en="BIOINFORMATICS · AI · SCIENTIFIC SOFTWARE" data-zh="生物信息学 · 人工智能 · 科研软件">BIOINFORMATICS · AI · SCIENTIFIC SOFTWARE</span></p>
        <h1>Jian Liu <span class="hero-name-cn">/ 刘健</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-role" data-en="Interdisciplinary Researcher" data-zh="交叉学科研究者">Interdisciplinary Researcher</p>
        <p class="hero-affiliation" data-en="Bioinformatics · Harbin Institute of Technology" data-zh="生物信息学 · 哈尔滨工业大学">Bioinformatics · Harbin Institute of Technology</p>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-en="I work at the intersection of bioinformatics, artificial intelligence, and scientific software. My interests include AI for Science, scientific agents and tool use, benchmark design for scientific applications, and computational biology." data-zh="我的研究兴趣位于生物信息学、人工智能与科研软件的交叉地带，关注科学人工智能、科研智能体与工具使用、科研软件基准评测，以及计算生物学。">
          I work at the intersection of bioinformatics, artificial intelligence, and scientific software. My interests include AI for Science, scientific agents and tool use, benchmark design for scientific applications, and computational biology.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-social-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/liuliu05115-spec" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/cv">Curriculum Vitae <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/research"><span data-en="Explore my research" data-zh="了解研究方向">Explore my research</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/projects"><span data-en="View selected projects" data-zh="查看代表项目">View selected projects</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block intro-strip">
    <div class="container intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">01 / ABOUT</p>
        <h2 data-en="Connecting biological questions with intelligent tools." data-zh="连接生物学问题与智能工具。">Connecting biological questions with intelligent tools.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p data-en="With a background in bioinformatics, I explore research questions that benefit from both biological understanding and computational systems. My work spans scientific agents and tool use, benchmark design for scientific software, and computational studies of cancer biology. I value transparent methods, reproducible evaluation, and evidence that can be independently inspected." data-zh="以生物信息学为学术背景，我关注同时需要生物学理解与计算系统支持的研究问题。当前工作涵盖科学智能体与工具使用、科研软件基准评测，以及肿瘤生物学计算研究。我重视方法透明、评估可复现，以及能够被独立审查的证据。">
          With a background in bioinformatics, I explore research questions that benefit from both biological understanding and computational systems. My work spans scientific agents and tool use, benchmark design for scientific software, and computational studies of cancer biology. I value transparent methods, reproducible evaluation, and evidence that can be independently inspected.
        </p>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/cv"><span data-en="Academic background & experience" data-zh="教育背景与学术经历">Academic background & experience</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">02 / RESEARCH FOCUS</p>
          <h2 data-en="Three connected research areas" data-zh="三个相互连接的研究方向">Three connected research areas</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/research"><span data-en="Explore research" data-zh="查看研究方向">Explore research</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-grid">
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">01</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-orbit">◎</div>
          <h3 data-en="AI for Science" data-zh="科学人工智能">AI for Science</h3>
          <p data-en="Scientific agents, evidence-grounded reasoning, and reliable multi-step research workflows." data-zh="科学智能体、基于证据的推理与可靠的多步骤科研工作流。">Scientific agents, evidence-grounded reasoning, and reliable multi-step research workflows.</p>
          <a href="/research#ai-for-science" aria-label="AI for Science research">↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">02</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-grid">▦</div>
          <h3 data-en="Scientific Software" data-zh="科研软件与基准评测">Scientific Software</h3>
          <p data-en="Evaluating GUI, MCP, and hybrid interaction across real scientific applications." data-zh="评估 GUI、MCP 及混合交互方式在真实科研软件中的能力与边界。">Evaluating GUI, MCP, and hybrid interaction across real scientific applications.</p>
          <a href="/research#scientific-software" aria-label="Scientific software research">↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">03</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-cell">◌</div>
          <h3 data-en="Computational Biology" data-zh="计算生物学与数字病理">Computational Biology</h3>
          <p data-en="Computational oncology, single-cell analysis, and morphology–molecular relationships." data-zh="计算肿瘤学、单细胞分析，以及组织形态与分子状态的关联研究。">Computational oncology, single-cell analysis, and morphology–molecular relationships.</p>
          <a href="/research#computational-biology" aria-label="Computational biology research">↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block selected-work-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">03 / SELECTED WORK</p>
          <h2 data-en="Research and projects" data-zh="科研与项目经历">Research and projects</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/projects"><span data-en="All selected projects" data-zh="全部代表项目">All selected projects</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="focus-grid">
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">AI / 01</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-orbit">✳</div>
          <h3>State2Combo</h3>
          <p data-en="A human-state-guided research prototype for therapeutic hypothesis generation and evidence retrieval." data-zh="以人类疾病状态为起点，进行治疗假设生成与证据检索的科研原型。">A human-state-guided research prototype for therapeutic hypothesis generation and evidence retrieval.</p>
          <a href="/projects#state2combo" aria-label="State2Combo project">↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">SOFTWARE / 02</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-grid">⌘</div>
          <h3 data-en="GUI vs. Structured Interfaces" data-zh="GUI 与结构化接口基准研究">GUI vs. Structured Interfaces</h3>
          <p data-en="A controlled benchmark across Cytoscape, PyMOL, and ImageJ, with 180 task trajectories." data-zh="覆盖 Cytoscape、PyMOL 和 ImageJ 的受控基准研究，已运行 180 条任务轨迹。">A controlled benchmark across Cytoscape, PyMOL, and ImageJ, with 180 task trajectories.</p>
          <a href="/projects#gui-benchmark" aria-label="GUI benchmark project">↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">BIOLOGY / 03</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-cell">◌</div>
          <h3 data-en="Silibinin & CRC Stroma" data-zh="水飞蓟宾与结直肠癌间质">Silibinin & CRC Stroma</h3>
          <p data-en="Undergraduate thesis integrating multi-cohort transcriptomics, single-cell evidence, and a mouse model." data-zh="整合多队列转录组、单细胞证据与小鼠模型的本科毕业研究。">Undergraduate thesis integrating multi-cohort transcriptomics, single-cell evidence, and a mouse model.</p>
          <a href="/projects#silibinin-crc" aria-label="Silibinin CRC project">↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">ENGINEERING / 04</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-grid">⌬</div>
          <h3 data-en="Yibao Medication Robot" data-zh="医宝智能分药机器人">Yibao Medication Robot</h3>
          <p data-en="A national undergraduate innovation project focused on medication dispensing and home health assistance." data-zh="国家级大学生创新训练计划项目，聚焦智能分药与家庭健康辅助。">A national undergraduate innovation project focused on medication dispensing and home health assistance.</p>
          <a href="/projects#yibao" aria-label="Yibao robot project">↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block publication-preview">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">04 / SELECTED PUBLICATION</p>
          <h2 data-en="First-author publication" data-zh="第一作者论文">First-author publication</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/publications"><span data-en="Publication details" data-zh="论文详情">Publication details</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <article class="publication-feature">
        <div class="publication-year">2026</div>
        <div class="publication-details">
          <span class="status-pill" data-en="PUBLISHED · FIRST AUTHOR" data-zh="已发表 · 第一作者">PUBLISHED · FIRST AUTHOR</span>
          <h3>Obesity-Driven Early-Onset Colorectal Cancer: Mechanistic Insights and Emerging Clinical Implications</h3>
          <p class="journal-name"><em>International Journal of Cancer</em></p>
          <p class="publication-note" data-en="Jian Liu, Jia Lu, Cuihong Dai, and Yingyu Zhou. 2026; 0:1–12. DOI: 10.1002/ijc.70609." data-zh="作者：Jian Liu、Jia Lu、Cuihong Dai、Yingyu Zhou。2026 年，0:1–12。DOI：10.1002/ijc.70609。">Jian Liu, Jia Lu, Cuihong Dai, and Yingyu Zhou. 2026; 0:1–12. DOI: 10.1002/ijc.70609.</p>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="https://doi.org/10.1002/ijc.70609" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span data-en="Read the article" data-zh="阅读论文">Read the article</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <span class="publication-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block experience-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">05 / EXPERIENCE</p>
          <h2 data-en="Beyond individual projects" data-zh="科研项目之外的经历">Beyond individual projects</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/cv"><span data-en="Background & honors" data-zh="经历与荣誉">Background & honors</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="focus-grid">
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">HIT</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-orbit">学</div>
          <h3 data-en="Bioinformatics Training" data-zh="生物信息学学习经历">Bioinformatics Training</h3>
          <p data-en="Undergraduate academic training at Harbin Institute of Technology." data-zh="在哈尔滨工业大学接受生物信息学本科阶段的学术训练。">Undergraduate academic training at Harbin Institute of Technology.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">2025–26</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-grid">AI</div>
          <h3 data-en="AI Engineering Internships" data-zh="AI 工程实习">AI Engineering Internships</h3>
          <p data-en="Experience with agent workflows, backend task orchestration, automation, and intelligent financial modeling." data-zh="参与智能体工作流、后端任务编排、自动化组件及智能财务建模相关工作。">Experience with agent workflows, backend task orchestration, automation, and intelligent financial modeling.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="focus-card">
          <span class="card-number">2025 / SG</span>
          <div class="focus-icon icon-cell">↗</div>
          <h3 data-en="Academic Exchange in Singapore" data-zh="新加坡学术交流">Academic Exchange in Singapore</h3>
          <p data-en="Visited NUS and NTU with an HIT academic exchange delegation, attending seminars and laboratory visits." data-zh="随哈工大学术交流团访问新加坡国立大学与南洋理工大学，参加学术讲座并参观实验室。">Visited NUS and NTU with an HIT academic exchange delegation, attending seminars and laboratory visits.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-section">
    <div class="container closing-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">06 / GET IN TOUCH</p>
      <h2 data-en="Interested in research collaboration?" data-zh="期待科研交流与合作。">Interested in research collaboration?</h2>
      <p data-en="I welcome conversations about scientific AI, scientific software, computational biology, and interdisciplinary research." data-zh="欢迎就科学人工智能、科研软件、计算生物学及交叉研究开展交流。">I welcome conversations about scientific AI, scientific software, computational biology, and interdisciplinary research.</p>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/contact"><span data-en="Contact me" data-zh="联系我">Contact me</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
